# @sgx4u/{{packageName}}

Replace this sentence with what `@sgx4u/{{packageName}}` sets up.

This preset is a workspace dev dependency. It is not published.

Each function lives in a kebab-case folder: `<name>.ts`, `<name>.types.ts`,
`<name>.test.ts`, and `<name>.md`. Shared code lives in
`constants/*.constants.ts`, `data/*.data.ts`, and `utils/*.utils.ts`.
`src/index.ts` re-exports the public functions and their public types. This
preset starts with those four files for `package-identifier`.

See [`packageIdentifier`](./src/package-identifier/package-identifier.md).

## Usage

```ts
import { packageIdentifier } from "@sgx4u/{{packageName}}";

packageIdentifier(); // "@sgx4u/{{packageName}}"
```

